# P2 (decay/tone) at 0, 128 and 255 on the 808 clap, the tambourine and the shaker.
tempo 90
steps 48
tail 4.0
track sample
param p2 0 0
note 0 54 1 120
note 4 69 1 120
note 8 67 1 120
param p2 128 16
note 16 54 1 120
note 20 69 1 120
note 24 67 1 120
param p2 255 32
note 32 54 1 120
note 36 69 1 120
note 40 67 1 120
expect sound 0 48
expect idle 90
expect peak_below -6
